      "sentence_id": 3,
      "text": "Mr. Avtar Singh Rawat, Additional Advocate General, Mr. V.K.Gemini, Deputy Advocate General and Mr. J. K. Bhatia, Standing Counsel, present for the State.\nHeard learned counsel for the parties and perused the documents brought on record.\nThe principal submission of learned counsel for the petitioners is that the Food Safety Appellate Tribunal has not been constituted in the State as yet and therefore, the petitioners cannot challenge the impugned order of the adjudicating Officer before the said Tribunal.",
